{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-emaar-cedar","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"emaar-cedar-in-creek-harbour","about":"Cedar Creek Beach is a luxury development by developer Emaar, located on Creek Beach. The complex features public areas and a variety of premium services and amenities: a large swimming pool with a terrace and sun loungers, an equipped gym, a children's play area, and co-working spaces. Residents of the complex also have access to a marina, stores, cafes and restaurants, a private beach with white sand and a large green park with walking paths, fountains and places for recreation with barbecues. Nearby is being built the largest shopping center in the world - Dubai Square Mall.The favorable location allows residents to quickly get to key locations in Dubai. Ras Al Khor Reserve, Downtown Dubai, Burj Khalifa and Dubai International Airport are all within a 10-minute drive from the complex, while Dubai Marina, Expo City and Palm Jumeirah are all within a 25-minute drive.The architecture of the building embodies modern standards of construction. High quality materials are used in the interiors and the panoramic windows offer mesmerizing views of the bay and Dubai skyline.Cedar will be an ideal place to live for young couples and families with children, and investors will be able to receive a stable income from renting out their property.","price":3408888,"title":"Emaar Cedar","bitrix":{"id":406,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Cedar","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Cedar","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Creek Harbour"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/46/images/2023/10/16/340x252/LPdmqFqmEm3XpZ4le30QV0QgmhFDi7CQ2pXKICCw.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/46/images/2023/10/16/464x312/LPdmqFqmEm3XpZ4le30QV0QgmhFDi7CQ2pXKICCw.webp"}],